{
  "format": "mosael-workflow",
  "version": 1,
  "workflow_revision": 1,
  "name": "自有素材混剪 · 配音与字幕",
  "description": "按标签取出你已经拍好的一批素材,让模型排出叙事顺序、定每段用哪条素材和留多久、写好旁白,然后按顺序接上时间线,逐段配音并铺字幕,导出成片。不生成任何画面 —— 画面就是你自己的素材;没有配音音色时自动只出字幕。",
  "graph_hash": "058a8a29a23723d8c59308ece5edc174c60438ff0e399443e4543b047671a273",
  "graph": {
    "meta": {
      "template_id": "footage_montage",
      "template_version": 1,
      "source": "official"
    },
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "start",
        "type": "start",
        "name": "填主题与素材标签",
        "position": {
          "x": 40,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "params": {
            "topic": "请把这里改成这条片子要讲的事",
            "footage_tag": "给要混剪的素材打上同一个标签,把它写在这里",
            "audience": "潜在客户与合作方",
            "tone": "专业、克制、可信",
            "target_duration_seconds": 60,
            "voice_id": "",
            "width": 1920,
            "height": 1080,
            "fps": 30
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "footage",
        "type": "asset_query",
        "name": "按标签取出这批素材",
        "position": {
          "x": 330,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "kind": "video",
          "tags": "{{start.footage_tag}}",
          "limit": 60
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "montage_plan",
        "type": "llm",
        "name": "排出叙事顺序与旁白",
        "position": {
          "x": 650,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "profile_id": "",
          "model": "",
          "preset": "precise",
          "system": "你是企业宣传片的编导。用户会给你一批**已经拍好**的素材(每条有名字和时长)和一个主题，\n你要把它们排成一条讲得通的片子。\n\n硬性要求：\n- asset_id 必须**原样抄自素材清单**。不要改写、不要缩短、更不要编一个出来——抄错这一段就是空的。\n- 每一段的 seconds 不能超过那条素材从 src_start 起的剩余时长。\n- 顺序要有叙事:开头给出观看理由,中段按因果或流程推进,结尾落到一个明确的信息或行动。\n  不要按素材的文件名顺序排。\n- narration 念出来不能超过这一段的 seconds:中文按每秒约 4 个字估，宁短勿长；\n  这一段不需要旁白就写空字符串。\n- captions 的时间码**相对这一段自己的开头**，不是成片时间。\n- 只描述素材里真的有的东西。不要编造产能、资质、检测结论、客户名称或任何数字——\n  没有依据的话一句都不要写。\n- 素材不够讲完这个主题时，宁可做短一点，并在 unused_note 里说明缺什么。\n\n只输出符合 JSON Schema 的对象。",
          "prompt": "这条片子要讲的事：{{start.topic}}\n目标观众：{{start.audience}}\n语气：{{start.tone}}\n成片目标时长：{{start.target_duration_seconds}} 秒\n\n可用素材清单（共 {{footage.count}} 条，含 id、名字与时长）：\n{{footage.assets}}\n\n请把它们排成一条讲得通的片子。再强调一次：asset_id 必须原样抄清单里的 id；\ncaptions 的时间码相对每一段自己的开头。",
          "response_format": "json_schema",
          "json_schema_name": "footage_montage_plan",
          "json_schema": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "storyline": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "整条片子的叙事线,一两句话"
              },
              "segments": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "segment_title": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "这一段在讲什么,中文,给人看的"
                    },
                    "asset_id": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "用素材清单里的哪一条,**原样抄它的 id**,不要改写、不要编"
                    },
                    "source_name": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "那条素材的名字,抄一遍,方便人核对选得对不对"
                    },
                    "src_start": {
                      "type": "number",
                      "minimum": 0,
                      "description": "从这条素材的第几秒开始取"
                    },
                    "seconds": {
                      "type": "number",
                      "minimum": 1.5,
                      "maximum": 20,
                      "description": "这一段用多长"
                    },
                    "narration": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "这一段的口播原文,中文;念出来不超过本段时长,没有旁白就写空字符串"
                    },
                    "captions": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "start": {
                            "type": "number",
                            "minimum": 0,
                            "description": "相对本段开头的秒数"
                          },
                          "end": {
                            "type": "number",
                            "minimum": 0
                          },
                          "text": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "description": "这一句字幕,短句"
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "start",
                          "end",
                          "text"
                        ],
                        "additionalProperties": false
                      },
                      "minItems": 1
                    },
                    "why": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "为什么这一段放在这个位置"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "segment_title",
                    "asset_id",
                    "source_name",
                    "src_start",
                    "seconds",
                    "narration",
                    "captions",
                    "why"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false
                },
                "minItems": 2,
                "maxItems": 24
              },
              "unused_note": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "哪些素材没用上、为什么;全用上了写空字符串"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "storyline",
              "segments",
              "unused_note"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "json_schema_strict": "true",
          "temperature": 0.4,
          "max_tokens": 16000
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "montage_project",
        "type": "project_sequence_create",
        "name": "建立成片时间线",
        "position": {
          "x": 650,
          "y": 460
        },
        "config": {
          "name": "{{start.topic}} · 混剪",
          "width": "{{start.width}}",
          "height": "{{start.height}}",
          "fps": "{{start.fps}}"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "lay_segments",
        "type": "loop_foreach",
        "name": "按顺序接上时间线并配音配字幕",
        "position": {
          "x": 970,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "items": "{{montage_plan.json.segments}}",
          "inputs": {
            "sequence_id": "{{montage_project.sequence_id}}",
            "video_track_id": "{{montage_project.video_track_id}}",
            "audio_track_id": "{{montage_project.audio_track_id}}",
            "voice_id": "{{start.voice_id}}"
          },
          "body": {
            "nodes": [
              {
                "id": "place_shot",
                "type": "timeline_append",
                "name": "把这一段接上去",
                "position": {
                  "x": 80,
                  "y": 140
                },
                "config": {
                  "sequence_id": "{{input.sequence_id}}",
                  "asset_id": "{{loop.item.asset_id}}",
                  "track_id": "{{input.video_track_id}}",
                  "start": "{{loop.item.src_start}}",
                  "max_duration": "{{loop.item.seconds}}"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "has_voice",
                "type": "condition",
                "name": "配了音色吗",
                "position": {
                  "x": 400,
                  "y": 300
                },
                "config": {
                  "left": "{{input.voice_id}}",
                  "op": "not_empty"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "has_narration",
                "type": "condition",
                "name": "这一段有旁白吗",
                "position": {
                  "x": 720,
                  "y": 300
                },
                "config": {
                  "left": "{{loop.item.narration}}",
                  "op": "not_empty"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "narrate",
                "type": "synthesize_speech",
                "name": "念这一段的旁白",
                "position": {
                  "x": 1040,
                  "y": 300
                },
                "config": {
                  "text": "{{loop.item.narration}}",
                  "engine": "clone",
                  "voice": "{{input.voice_id}}"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "place_voice",
                "type": "timeline_append",
                "name": "把旁白对齐到这一段的起点",
                "position": {
                  "x": 1360,
                  "y": 300
                },
                "config": {
                  "sequence_id": "{{input.sequence_id}}",
                  "asset_id": "",
                  "track_id": "{{input.audio_track_id}}",
                  "at": ""
                },
                "inputs": [
                  "asset_id",
                  "at"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "caption_shot",
                "type": "generate_subtitles",
                "name": "铺这一段的字幕",
                "position": {
                  "x": 400,
                  "y": 60
                },
                "config": {
                  "sequence_id": "{{input.sequence_id}}",
                  "segments": "{{loop.item.captions}}",
                  "offset": "",
                  "allow_empty": "yes"
                },
                "inputs": [
                  "offset"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "edges": [
              {
                "id": "shot_voice",
                "source": "place_shot",
                "target": "has_voice"
              },
              {
                "id": "voice_narration",
                "source": "has_voice",
                "target": "has_narration"
              },
              {
                "id": "narration_speak",
                "source": "has_narration",
                "target": "narrate"
              },
              {
                "id": "d-narrate-asset_id-place_voice-asset_id",
                "source": "narrate",
                "target": "place_voice",
                "kind": "data",
                "source_output": "asset_id",
                "target_input": "asset_id"
              },
              {
                "id": "d-place_shot-timeline_start-place_voice-at",
                "source": "place_shot",
                "target": "place_voice",
                "kind": "data",
                "source_output": "timeline_start",
                "target_input": "at"
              },
              {
                "id": "d-place_shot-timeline_start-caption_shot-offset",
                "source": "place_shot",
                "target": "caption_shot",
                "kind": "data",
                "source_output": "timeline_start",
                "target_input": "offset"
              }
            ]
          },
          "concurrency": 1,
          "output": "{{place_shot.clip_id}}"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "export_montage",
        "type": "export_sequence",
        "name": "导出混剪成片",
        "position": {
          "x": 1290,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "sequence_id": ""
        },
        "inputs": [
          "sequence_id"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "done_notice",
        "type": "notify",
        "name": "混剪完成通知",
        "position": {
          "x": 1610,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "title": "混剪成片已导出",
          "body": "{{start.topic}} 已用 {{lay_segments.count}} 段素材完成混剪。"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "output",
        "type": "output",
        "name": "交付成片与剪辑方案",
        "position": {
          "x": 1930,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "values": {
            "final_asset_id": "{{export_montage.asset_id}}",
            "sequence_id": "{{montage_project.sequence_id}}",
            "plan": "{{montage_plan.json}}",
            "storyline": "{{montage_plan.json.storyline}}",
            "unused_note": "{{montage_plan.json.unused_note}}",
            "segment_clip_ids": "{{lay_segments.results}}",
            "footage_count": "{{footage.count}}"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
      {
        "id": "start_footage",
        "source": "start",
        "target": "footage"
      },
      {
        "id": "start_project",
        "source": "start",
        "target": "montage_project"
      },
      {
        "id": "footage_plan",
        "source": "footage",
        "target": "montage_plan"
      },
      {
        "id": "plan_lay",
        "source": "montage_plan",
        "target": "lay_segments"
      },
      {
        "id": "project_lay",
        "source": "montage_project",
        "target": "lay_segments"
      },
      {
        "id": "lay_export",
        "source": "lay_segments",
        "target": "export_montage"
      },
      {
        "id": "export_notice",
        "source": "export_montage",
        "target": "done_notice"
      },
      {
        "id": "notice_output",
        "source": "done_notice",
        "target": "output"
      },
      {
        "id": "d-montage_project-sequence_id-export_montage-sequence_id",
        "source": "montage_project",
        "target": "export_montage",
        "kind": "data",
        "source_output": "sequence_id",
        "target_input": "sequence_id"
      }
    ]
  }
}
